Package: chronodiag
Type: Package
Title: Assistive Diagnostics for Tree-Ring Chronology Coherence
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: person("Hitoshi", "Yonenobu", email = "yn@naruto-u.ac.jp", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1596-7543"))
Description: Native R implementation of model-relative reliability,
    covariance architecture, and composition-aware diagnostics for tree-ring
    chronologies. The package does not assign a universal chronology-strength
    score or automatic pass/fail classification.
